# s4biz:site BEGIN — managed by deploy_direct.py. Edit THIS file, never the droplet's Caddyfile.
#
# The markers are the whole safety mechanism. The deploy deletes strictly between them and appends
# this file again, so it can never touch another project's block. A range delete keyed on a WORD
# instead ("/s4biz/,/^}/d") eventually starts inside somebody else's comment and truncates their
# site: that has happened on this exact host and produced a six hour outage.
s4biz.io, www.s4biz.io {
	encode zstd gzip
	reverse_proxy s4biz-web:8000
}
# s4biz:site END
